_bmad-output/brainstorming/brainstorm-tamagai-parent-config-2026-09-27/.memlog.md:120:- (insight) Mirror and belonging: the pet sharing the child's diet, language, holidays and traits (glasses, conditions) is the emotional payoff of configuration — and a product line (culture packs)
